\nSo, Sarah painted 9 eggs, and Camden painted 21 eggs.\n\nNow, use the total eggs equation:\n\n$$\nA + M + C + S = 56\n$$\n\nWe know $ A = M $, and we already found $ C = 21 $, $ S = 9 $, so:\n\n$$\nA + A + 21 + 9 = 56 \\\\\n2A + 30 = 56 \\\\\n2A = 26 \\\\\nA = 13\n$$\n\nSo, Arnold painted 13 eggs, and Madeline also painted 13 eggs.\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Answer the question\n\n**How many more eggs did Camden paint than Arnold?**\n\n$$\nC - A = 21 - 13 = \\boxed{8}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{8}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 3.1383934230543673, "draft_calls": 85, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 88, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "16cf8c2000e8b55e51ce3c60c7707d0a98229e4818cf9471a234fa20e7bc660b", "method": "relay_svd1536", "output_hash": "c063037f268f2dfdc91986e5f45e1c673872154d12622f3625539c66fa0931b6", "output_tokens": 578, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 23495000064, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 23779606528, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1121bf3acb3c86f0", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 536.8937945365906, "prefill_full_target": 32.90719985961914, "prefill_relay": 0.1632319986820221, "relay": 18.894239991903305, "unattributed_runtime": 36.63360953330994, "verification_full_target": 2547.806879043579}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15], "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "8", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 3.173298954963684, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 23779606528, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 23779606528, "target_calls": 85, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03311776090413332, "turn_index": 0}
